# Open Maps: map data refresh. Runs nightly at 3:30 AM (after the 3:00
# Jellyfin scan); the job itself decides whether an update is due: about
# every 28 days, retrying a failed run on the next nights (at most 5 in a
# row). On a night with nothing due it reads two local files and exits:
# no network, no output. The build refuses to start unless the models leave
# it enough free memory. Replace @HOMEBOT_DIR@ (the checkout) and
# @DATA_DIR@ (the API service's PUFFPAI_DATA_DIR) before installing it.
30 3 * * * PUFFPAI_DATA_DIR=@DATA_DIR@ /bin/bash @HOMEBOT_DIR@/deploy/maps/refresh.sh run >> @DATA_DIR@/maps_refresh.err 2>&1
